{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, גַּו","hw":"גַּו","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גַּו</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. midst (</strong>Egyptian Aramaic Nab. Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">גו</span>; 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּיו</span>; especially cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגוֹ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְגוֹ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִגּוֹ</span>; so Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܰܘ</span>; cf.BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, גַּו\" href=\"/BDB,_גַּו\", dir=\"rtl\">גֵּו</a>, p. 156<strong>)</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹא</span> (so Nab. Cooke<sup>No. 94</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:26\" href=\"/Daniel.3.26\">Dn 3:26</a> +, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:15\" href=\"/Daniel.7.15\">7:15</a> edd., Gi <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹ</span> (Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹא</span>, v. on <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:6\" href=\"/Daniel.3.6\">3:6</a>); sf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּוֵּהּ</span> †<a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:7\" href=\"/Ezra.5.7\">Ezr 5:7</a>, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּוַּהּ</span> †<a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:15\" href=\"/Ezra.4.15\">4:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:2\" href=\"/Ezra.6.2\">6:2</a>;—<em>midst</em>, always c. preps.:<br><strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגוֹא</span> (= Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּתוֹךְ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:25\" href=\"/Daniel.3.25\">Dn 3:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגוֹא נוּרָא</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:7\" href=\"/Daniel.4.7\">4:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:15\" href=\"/Daniel.7.15\">7:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:15\" href=\"/Ezra.4.15\">Ezr 4:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:7\" href=\"/Ezra.5.7\">5:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וְכִדְנָה כְתִיב בְּגַוֵּהּ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:2\" href=\"/Ezra.6.2\">6:2</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">לְגוֹא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:6\" href=\"/Daniel.3.6\">Dn 3:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:11\" href=\"/Daniel.3.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:15\" href=\"/Daniel.3.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:21\" href=\"/Daniel.3.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:23\" href=\"/Daniel.3.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:24\" href=\"/Daniel.3.24\">24</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן־גּוֹא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:26\" href=\"/Daniel.3.26\">Dn 3:26</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, גֵּוָה²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, גְּדַד"}